window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-026.json",{"day":26,"title":"The Hospital That Learned to Coordinate","targetWords":[{"word":"contaminate","gloss":"污染","context":"A leaking pipe could contaminate supplies, while poor storage could allow materials to rot and equipment to deteriorate.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"deteriorate","gloss":"恶化","context":"A leaking pipe could contaminate supplies, while poor storage could allow materials to rot and equipment to deteriorate.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":{"en":"conditions deteriorate","zh":"状况恶化"}},{"word":"tire","gloss":"使疲惫","context":"Staff warned that endless alerts would irritate nurses and tire them before a shift ended.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"aggravate","gloss":"加剧","context":"Careless repairs might aggravate the problem rather than solve it.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"constrain","gloss":"限制","context":"A schedule that worked on a quiet morning could suddenly constrain the team when patient numbers began to swell after an unexpected accident nearby.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":{"en":"constrain participation","zh":"限制参与"}},{"word":"frustrate","gloss":"挫败","context":"Administrators wanted to mobilize volunteers and propel the project forward; experienced nurses feared that new duties would frustrate people already stretched thin.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"refresh","gloss":"更新","context":"Managers agreed to differentiate urgent warnings from routine reminders and refresh the layout accordingly.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"swell","gloss":"激增","context":"A schedule that worked on a quiet morning could suddenly constrain the team when patient numbers began to swell after an unexpected accident nearby.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"acquaint","gloss":"使熟悉","context":"The first task was to acquaint everyone with the new system without letting training disrupt essential care.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"disrupt","gloss":"干扰","context":"The first task was to acquaint everyone with the new system without letting training disrupt essential care.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"embody","gloss":"体现","context":"The project came to embody a useful principle: institutions should abide by their responsibilities even when no outsider is watching.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"propel","gloss":"推进","context":"Administrators wanted to mobilize volunteers and propel the project forward; experienced nurses feared that new duties would frustrate people already stretched thin.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"slide","gloss":"幻灯片","context":"The compromise was less impressive on a presentation slide, yet it was more likely to survive the pressures of an ordinary working week.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"reconcile","gloss":"调和","context":"The exercise did not eliminate uncertainty, but it helped reconcile the demand for speed with the duty to protect vulnerable people.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"unify","gloss":"使成为一体","context":"They hoped to augment available expertise, align referral procedures, and unify the information patients received.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"situate","gloss":"安排在","context":"Its leader chose to situate the first meetings in ordinary wards, where staff could see the consequences of delay.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"terminate","gloss":"终止","context":"Teams therefore practiced how to terminate a dangerous process before harm occurred.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"adhere","gloss":"遵守","context":"An engineer explained how to fasten temporary barriers, adhere to inspection rules, and execute a safe shutdown.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"fluctuate","gloss":"波动","context":"They also accepted that demand would fluctuate.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":{"en":"prices fluctuate","zh":"价格波动"}},{"word":"irritate","gloss":"使烦躁","context":"Staff warned that endless alerts would irritate nurses and tire them before a shift ended.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"comprise","gloss":"包含","context":"The project would comprise scheduling, transport, and records, not simply a new logo.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"prosper","gloss":"良好发展","context":"A hospital cannot prosper when its departments operate like separate islands.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"reassure","gloss":"使安心","context":"Patients ultimately judged the system by whether it could reassure them and prevent important information from going missing.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"saturate","gloss":"塞满","context":"Staff learned not to saturate conversations with technical details or confuse compliance with genuine understanding.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"confuse","gloss":"混淆","context":"Staff learned not to saturate conversations with technical details or confuse compliance with genuine understanding.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"deploy","gloss":"部署","context":"Digital specialists could deploy impressive screens that seemed to dazzle visitors, but a confusing interface might impair treatment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"explode","gloss":"爆炸","context":"Nobody wanted an oxygen container to explode or an electrical fault to wreck a ward.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"wreck","gloss":"毁坏","context":"Nobody wanted an oxygen container to explode or an electrical fault to wreck a ward.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"augment","gloss":"增加","context":"They hoped to augment available expertise, align referral procedures, and unify the information patients received.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"flatter","gloss":"讨好","context":"It would be easy to flatter either side with promises, but harder to concede the limits of the budget.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"impair","gloss":"损害","context":"Digital specialists could deploy impressive screens that seemed to dazzle visitors, but a confusing interface might impair treatment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"perish","gloss":"死亡","context":"Otherwise people may suffer, and in extreme cases perish, because procedures look efficient on paper while failing to connect the people who depend on them.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"affiliate","gloss":"建立合作","context":"In one regional center, managers decided to consolidate several support teams and affiliate with nearby clinics.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"align","gloss":"统一","context":"They hoped to augment available expertise, align referral procedures, and unify the information patients received.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"concede","gloss":"承认","context":"It would be easy to flatter either side with promises, but harder to concede the limits of the budget.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"consolidate","gloss":"整合","context":"In one regional center, managers decided to consolidate several support teams and affiliate with nearby clinics.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"dazzle","gloss":"使赞叹","context":"Digital specialists could deploy impressive screens that seemed to dazzle visitors, but a confusing interface might impair treatment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"fasten","gloss":"固定","context":"An engineer explained how to fasten temporary barriers, adhere to inspection rules, and execute a safe shutdown.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"perplex","gloss":"使困惑","context":"A puzzling complaint might perplex one department while helping another identify a serious flaw.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"shatter","gloss":"破坏","context":"A disagreement over staffing threatened to shatter cooperation.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"unite","gloss":"联合","context":"An open discussion helped unite the departments around a smaller initial goal.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"differentiate","gloss":"区分","context":"Managers agreed to differentiate urgent warnings from routine reminders and refresh the layout accordingly.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"execute","gloss":"执行","context":"An engineer explained how to fasten temporary barriers, adhere to inspection rules, and execute a safe shutdown.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"intrigue","gloss":"引起兴趣","context":"Such cases began to intrigue the designers rather than embarrass them.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"mingle","gloss":"交流","context":"People who rarely had time to mingle discovered that their difficulties were closely connected, even when their job titles suggested otherwise.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"rot","gloss":"腐烂","context":"A leaking pipe could contaminate supplies, while poor storage could allow materials to rot and equipment to deteriorate.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"mobilize","gloss":"动员","context":"Administrators wanted to mobilize volunteers and propel the project forward; experienced nurses feared that new duties would frustrate people already stretched thin.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"abide","gloss":"遵守","context":"The project came to embody a useful principle: institutions should abide by their responsibilities even when no outsider is watching.","contextParagraph":4,"collocation":null},{"word":"bolster","gloss":"支持","context":"The director chose to bolster existing teams first and deter unsafe shortcuts.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"deter","gloss":"阻止","context":"The director chose to bolster existing teams first and deter unsafe shortcuts.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A hospital cannot prosper when its departments operate like separate islands. In one regional center, managers decided to consolidate several support teams and affiliate with nearby clinics. They hoped to augment available expertise, align referral procedures, and unify the information patients received. The project would comprise scheduling, transport, and records, not simply a new logo. Its leader chose to situate the first meetings in ordinary wards, where staff could see the consequences of delay. People who rarely had time to mingle discovered that their difficulties were closely connected, even when their job titles suggested otherwise.","zh":"如果各科像孤岛般运作，医院就无法良好发展。一家区域医疗中心决定整合支持团队，并与附近诊所建立合作。他们希望扩大可用专业力量、统一转诊流程和患者收到的信息。项目包括排期、交通和病历，而不只是换标识。负责人把首次会议安排在普通病房，让人员直接看到延误的后果。平时少有机会交流的人发现，虽然职位不同，他们遇到的困难却紧密相关。"},{"en":"The first task was to acquaint everyone with the new system without letting training disrupt essential care. Digital specialists could deploy impressive screens that seemed to dazzle visitors, but a confusing interface might impair treatment. Staff warned that endless alerts would irritate nurses and tire them before a shift ended. Managers agreed to differentiate urgent warnings from routine reminders and refresh the layout accordingly. They also accepted that demand would fluctuate. A schedule that worked on a quiet morning could suddenly constrain the team when patient numbers began to swell after an unexpected accident nearby.","zh":"首项任务是让大家熟悉新系统，同时不让培训干扰基本照护。数字专家能部署让游客赞叹的屏幕，但混乱界面可能损害治疗。员工警告，无休止的提示会使护士烦躁，在轮班结束前便已疲惫。管理者同意区分紧急警报与普通提醒，并据此更新布局。他们还接受需求会波动：安静早晨适用的排期，在附近意外导致患者骤增时，可能突然限制团队行动。"},{"en":"Practical risks soon tested the plan. A leaking pipe could contaminate supplies, while poor storage could allow materials to rot and equipment to deteriorate. Careless repairs might aggravate the problem rather than solve it. An engineer explained how to fasten temporary barriers, adhere to inspection rules, and execute a safe shutdown. Nobody wanted an oxygen container to explode or an electrical fault to wreck a ward. Teams therefore practiced how to terminate a dangerous process before harm occurred. The exercise did not eliminate uncertainty, but it helped reconcile the demand for speed with the duty to protect vulnerable people.","zh":"实际风险很快考验了计划。漏水管道会污染物资，不良储存会使材料腐败、设备恶化。草率维修可能加剧问题。工程师讲解如何固定临时屏障、遵守检查规则、执行安全停机。没人希望氧气容器爆炸或电路故障毁掉病房，所以团队练习在伤害发生前终止危险流程。演练没有消除不确定性，却帮助协调了快速行动的要求和保护脆弱人群的责任。"},{"en":"A disagreement over staffing threatened to shatter cooperation. Administrators wanted to mobilize volunteers and propel the project forward; experienced nurses feared that new duties would frustrate people already stretched thin. It would be easy to flatter either side with promises, but harder to concede the limits of the budget. The director chose to bolster existing teams first and deter unsafe shortcuts. An open discussion helped unite the departments around a smaller initial goal. The compromise was less impressive on a presentation slide, yet it was more likely to survive the pressures of an ordinary working week.","zh":"人员配置争议险些破坏合作。行政部门想动员志愿者、推进项目，资深护士担心新职责挫败已经忙不过来的员工。用承诺讨好双方容易，承认预算限制却难。院长决定先加强现有团队，阻止不安全的捷径。公开讨论让各科围绕较小的初期目标团结起来。妥协方案在幻灯片上不那么耀眼，却更可能经受普通工作周的压力。"},{"en":"Patients ultimately judged the system by whether it could reassure them and prevent important information from going missing. Staff learned not to saturate conversations with technical details or confuse compliance with genuine understanding. A puzzling complaint might perplex one department while helping another identify a serious flaw. Such cases began to intrigue the designers rather than embarrass them. The project came to embody a useful principle: institutions should abide by their responsibilities even when no outsider is watching. Otherwise people may suffer, and in extreme cases perish, because procedures look efficient on paper while failing to connect the people who depend on them.","zh":"患者最终依据系统能否使他们安心、防止重要信息丢失来判断。员工学会不把谈话塞满技术细节，也不把服从等同于真正理解。一项令人困惑的投诉可能难住某科，却帮助另一科发现严重缺陷。设计者逐渐对这些案例产生兴趣，而不只是感到尴尬。项目体现了一个有用原则：即使没有外人监督，机构也必须遵守责任。否则，程序纸面高效，却无法连接相互依赖的人，就可能使人受苦，极端情况下甚至丧命。"}],"previous":25,"next":27});
